{"parse": {"title": "5SP-03", "pageid": 8641, "text": "<div class=\"mw-parser-output\"><div class=\"tabber no-indent\"><div class=\"episode-inter-nav\"><a href=\"/wiki/5SP-02\" title=\"5SP-02\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a><span class=\"nav-page-name\">5SP-03</span><a href=\"/wiki/5SP-04\" title=\"5SP-04\"><img alt=\"Btn zuo.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/18px-Btn_zuo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"18\" height=\"26\" class=\"img-rotate\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/27px-Btn_zuo.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/Btn_zuo.png/36px-Btn_zuo.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"64\" data-file-height=\"92\" /></a></div><div class=\"episode-panel\"><div style=\"position: relative; padding-left: 35px;\"><div class=\"episode-deco\"><div class=\"episode-deco-1\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-2\"></div><div class=\"episode-deco-3\"></div></div><div class=\"episode-index\"><span class=\"episode-index-chapter\">5SP</span><span class=\"episode-index-number\">03</span></div><h2 style=\"position:absolute; opacity:0; pointer-events:none;width:0; height:0; overflow:hidden;\"><span id=\".E9.80.9A.E5.A4.A9.E4.B9.8B.E5.A1.94\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"通天之塔\">通天之塔</span></h2><div class=\"episode-title\"> 通天之塔</div><div class=\"episode-subtitle\">Tower of Babel</div></div><div><div class=\"episode-navbar\"><div class=\"tabber-filter auto-first\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 0 -4px;\"></div></div></div></div><div class=\"episode-switchbtn\"><small style=\"color: #999;\">头像 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyHeadicon mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small> <small style=\"color: #999;\">背景图 <div class=\"switchbtn\" style=\"display: inline-block;\"><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\"><img alt=\"显示\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/20px-Btn_watch_nor.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"显示\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/30px-Btn_watch_nor.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/2/2e/Btn_watch_nor.png/40px-Btn_watch_nor.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i><i class=\"mw-customtoggle-storyBg mw-customtoggle-\" style=\"display: none;\"><img alt=\"隐藏\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/20px-Btn_watch_selected.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"隐藏\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/30px-Btn_watch_selected.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/Btn_watch_selected.png/40px-Btn_watch_selected.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"56\" data-file-height=\"56\" /></i></div></small></div><div class=\"episode-desc\"><div style=\"display:flex;\"><div style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span class=\"color-value\"></span>大<span class=\"color-value\"></span>多<span class=\"color-value\"></span>数<span class=\"color-value\"></span>时<span class=\"color-value\"></span>候<span class=\"color-value\"></span>，<span class=\"color-value\"></span>语<span class=\"color-value\"></span>言<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>通<span class=\"color-value\"></span>只<span class=\"color-value\"></span>是<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>与<span class=\"color-value\"></span>人<span class=\"color-value\"></span>之<span class=\"color-value\"></span>间<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>最<span class=\"color-value\"></span>为<span class=\"color-value\"></span>微<span class=\"color-value\"></span>不<span class=\"color-value\"></span>足<span class=\"color-value\"></span>道<span class=\"color-value\"></span>的<span class=\"color-value\"></span>障<span class=\"color-value\"></span>碍<span class=\"color-value\"></span>。<span class=\"color-value\"></span></div><div class=\"grey-small hide-m\" style=\"float:right;\">ID: 31003</div></div></div><div class=\"battle-panel\"><div class=\"story no-indent\"><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>神秘主义和数学混合……地中海的轮渡……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304117.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304117.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/92/HeadIconSmall-304117.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304117.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>真不可思议……居然真的有调查员遇上了那个信仰数字的神秘学家团体，还留下了珍贵的文字资料。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>这也就是说，我们离帮到维尔汀不远了吗？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>纪律辅员的第一助手发出欢呼。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>那是当然，这是我们今天辛劳应得的回报！……可是，这么重要的记录为什么会被遗弃在“非必要信息”资料室呢？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304118.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304118.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/8/80/HeadIconSmall-304118.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304118.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>是在“暴雨”后的混乱中误放了吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达收起困惑，翻开记录的下一页。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>这里面最好相处的人是休。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>他是一名神秘学家出身的工程师。对人类科技的偏爱多少让我们有了些共同话题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>休三十来岁，红头发，脸颊凹陷，因罹患眼疾而深感忧郁。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>他为人严谨正直，总是伏案工作。让我想到苏丹宫廷里的细密画大师，因为一生辛劳最终双目失明。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>他给我看了他女儿的照片……虽然我没有子女，但能感受到他为人父母的喜悦。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>在这个团体里，休反而是最格格不入的那个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>他们实质上的领头人是“她”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我不知道该如何形容……她就像陨星，飓风，一场不可理喻的天灾本身。就像她的名字一样，简单，却蕴含甚多。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>请原谅我的软弱。时至今日，我依然不想写下她的名字——如果那可以称为名字。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>实际上，“她”很亲切，相当热情，在我接触的所有未登记神秘学家里，对基金会是相当友好的一个。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>她看起来很年轻，尽管我听说她也有女儿。她保持了孩童的那种纯真，我所熟悉的属于天才的眼神——整个世界在她看来就像一个闪闪发光的玩具。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>最开始，交流还是令人振奋的。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我们都渴望弄清这里发生了什么……就像两个海上漂流的难民牢牢地握住彼此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>但事实上我完全不懂她在说什么。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>这不是那种人类和神秘学家无法沟通的问题。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我确信我们的语言并无实质障碍。但我不理解她所用的每一个词。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>倘若一个人能在瞬间说出11567的所有因数，那我理应相信她拥有很高的智力。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>可我听见的却是一番莫名其妙，不清不楚，毫无逻辑的空话！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>她宣称存在一个至高无上的数字天国，在那里万物的本质以抽象的形式永恒存在。而具有时间的物理世界不过是附属的次等品，从未完全真实过。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>因此眼下世界的混乱是无足轻重的，重要的是弄清“至高存在”发生了什么事。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>这完全是现代数学和古代迷信的灾难结合，柏拉图主义起尸回魂的梦呓，又一个自诩先知的狂妄神秘学家……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>更别提那些关于“灵魂数字”的命理鬼话……整个新纪元运动都产生不了这么多胡言乱语。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>她竟然还声称自己已知晓了下一个倒退的年份！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>可当我认真询问时，她又说：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“噢，抱歉，我发过誓，不能把证明告诉灵魂没有数字的人。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>……我不知道她是存心戏弄我，还是来真的。可她好像真的很想告诉我，她是如何灵光一闪，就此知晓了那天赐的奥秘……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>在她那里，一切规律似乎是直观地被她洞悉，而不是基于逻辑的推演。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“你难道看不见吗？它就在你眼前！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>在我第三十次表达不能理解后，她深感遗憾。我倒宁愿这是一种新型羞辱……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>但真正激怒我的是她对科学和实验方法的蔑视。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>在我看来，一个理论最重要的是真实可信，具备普遍性和可推广性。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>这份“真”正是近代科学的基础，通过它，我们得以改造世界。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>而在她看来，最重要的是它够不够“美”。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我和她谈论现状，倘若我们能找到“暴雨”的规律，就能帮助更多人越过雨幕，保存珍贵的科技和文化。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>这并非易事，需要大量的人力。因此我也真挚地邀请他们加入。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>而她则对此嗤之以鼻。她怀疑这最多是帮助基金会扩张一支军队……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“亲爱的，纯粹的数学之所以美丽，就在于它一点用也没有。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“因此它才能在这个肮脏的世界上保持高洁，尽管你们人类还是会把它拿去计算弹道。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>她拒绝了合作邀请，并对我们的“暴雨”观测计划大加贬低。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“你们的观测站必将迎来失败！因为它仰赖的是脆弱的物理世界。你们的努力就像是在沙滩上钉下钉子——它只会随着下一次海潮的冲刷毁灭。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>当时，我回答：“也许这是沙上砌塔的无用功。可是总需要有人去做。在每一个沙滩上的角落都被遍历前，谁也不能断言我们脚下的世界已经是无可救药的废墟。”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“哈哈哈，多么严谨、务实、理性的发言！可是亲爱的，这个世界就是废墟呀！”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>谈话无果而终。我不知道神秘学家对世界的仇恨来自何处，也许因为他们从未被这个世界接纳。我仍记得她恶毒地断言：</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">“她”：</div><div>“你们人类赖以为生的经验世界已经终结了。用你们最爱讥讽我们的话来说——为什么不接受现实呢？”</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>可是，对于她所深信的灵知，那些用数字发布的预言，她也从未给出过任何有严格逻辑的证明细节。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>理由，理由竟是因为她在某块石头前发了禁言的誓……！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>所以这里只是一堆神棍的疯言疯语。我本以为她会有别于那些将前额叶的错乱误认为神意的疯子，结果还是如此。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div class=\"story-text--name\">记录者：</div><div>我以人类的理智起誓，我坚信这一切纯属荒谬。直到……</div></div><div class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyBg\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6:Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" class=\"image\" title=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\"><img alt=\"guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/600px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"600\" height=\"250\" class=\"story-bg\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/900px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/7/73/Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png/1200px-Cg-guanjiaoxuexiaotushuguan.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"2592\" data-file-height=\"1080\" /></a></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>唔，记得Z女士说过，那个岛上神秘学家的名字都是数字，因为他们笃信这是一个人的本质。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>记录者不愿意说出“她”的名字，是因为信仰上的冲突吗？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达迫不及待地翻到下一页，就像是在检查在校生违规带入课堂的小说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>现实却让她的期待落了空。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……咦，这就是最后一页了？！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>兴许是戛然而止的冒险故事，又或是白白落了一场空的欣喜，令纪律辅员焦急地攥紧了手帕。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>贸然提交中断在一半的报告，只会造成审理和评估的困难！可这个记录者甚至没有留下自己的名字……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>别担心，玛蒂尔达小姐，我经常遇见这种问题。勇敢的提丰赶走朱庇特之后，它便会回到自动小岛……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>但只要我们扭动玻璃匣子先生的耳廓，提丰就会一次又一次地跑出来。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>莫桑老师说过，它是开启希望的门阀～！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>等等，你说的该不会是机械扫描电视上的动画片吧……？</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>罔顾纪律辅员的疑惑，热情的小淑女开始左顾右盼，似乎在寻找着那只寄寓希望的耳廓。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……苏芙比小姐，请先停止你的行为。接着，请端坐在软垫上，听我说。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>这是一份详尽的、由正式的基金会调查员写下的记录。它绝不是故意吊人胃口的电视节目，所以，我们一定能在别的什么地方找到它的其余部分！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>噢！苏芙比知道了！一定是一只可可树精叼走了典籍的下半部分！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>通常只要用少量的固银引诱，就能在马厩发现被它埋起来的巢穴……</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>你是说有人把它拿走了吗？很有可能，毕竟基金会不应发生这种资料遗失问题——尤其是在纪律辅员的管辖范围之内。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>那我们得赶紧准备固银，还有可可树精最爱的蹦蹦跳跳魔力弹豆！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"300901.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"300901.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/fb/HeadIconSmall-300901.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-300901.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">苏芙比：</div><div>唔，苏芙比现在没有携带这么多材料，但我可以写信……只要静静等待一个月就好！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>这番跳跃的对话着实使严谨的纪律辅员有些难以忍受。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>……不，我们不需要那些！</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>玛蒂尔达深呼吸一口气，坚定地掏出自己的水晶球。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><div>她的脸上出现了志在必得的笑容。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>做得好，苏芙比助手。你找到了这份珍贵的文件，已经圆满且出色地完成了我分配给你的任务。</div></div><div class=\"story-text\"><span class=\"mw-collapsible mw-collapsed story-text--headicon\" id=\"mw-customcollapsible-storyHeadicon\"><img alt=\"304101.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/23px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"304101.png\" width=\"23\" height=\"23\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/35px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/9/9a/HeadIconSmall-304101.png/46px-HeadIconSmall-304101.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"140\" data-file-height=\"140\" /></span><div class=\"story-text--name\">玛蒂尔达：</div><div>现在只需要伟大的玛蒂尔达……稍稍出面！</div></div></div></div></div></div>", "categories": [{"sortkey": "", "category": "没有战斗的章节", "hidden": true}, {"sortkey": "", "category": "章节"}], "displaytitle": "5SP-03"}}